{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t阿富汗有民房爆炸，造成10人喪生、過百人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\n爆炸發生在東北部庫納爾省首府阿薩達巴德市，官員說，當地一間中學附近，有堆放炸藥的房屋爆炸，該批炸藥用於採礦和爆破工作。部分輕傷者接受治理後已經出院，其餘傷者仍然留院。<br/>\n<br/>\n當局說，遇難者包括中學學生，正在調查事件，稍後公布更多細節。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T13:19:24.071825+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T12:52:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:13:10.538426+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T13:12:40.878697+00:00","content_hash":"b5d43d88beca849e9d9d5513f1e1ee19bf75bea55a28bde673e08e2847ab3bfa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}